<title>FINLAND: Raisio says Monsanto plan unclear.</title>
<headline>Raisio says Monsanto plan unclear.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food group Raisio said on Thursday it did not know enough about a cholesterol-cutting oil to be developed by U.S. Monsanto Co to say if the product could become a rival to its Benecol agent.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't know enough about it yet,&quot; Raisio Yhtyma Oy spokesman Sten von Hellens told Reuters by telephone. &quot;If it is a vegetable oil...then it may not be a direct competitor.&quot;</p>
</text>
